    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya na Obadia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyūbīta ikanza lya shikū ningī; yahayūshika myaka idatū, mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wilongela ū Eliya. Gūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkiyooleche ū kūlī Ahabu, nakwenha mbula ītūle ū mu sī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūja ūkiyoolecha ū kūlī Ahabu; ū mu shikū jenījo ī nzala yūsangwa yapembeka kīngī nasho ū mu Samalia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose ū Ahabu ūng'witana ū Obadia ūyo walī ntaale wa kahelele ka milīmo ya ng'wikūlū, (ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ū Obadia walī na logohano lūtaale ū kūlī SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makanza malebe ū Yezebeli akabasalīla kūbabūlaga bahangi ba ng'wa SEEBA; ū Obadia ūbasola bahangi igana ūbabisa mu mahalo abīlī, būl'ihalo ūtūūla mo banhū makūmi atanò, ūyūbinha ī shilīwa na a minzī.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Ahabu ūng'wīla ū Obadia, “Fumaga ūje ūkūyeela yeelaga pye a hose ūko ūlaabone mataba na mahululu ga minzī, hamo tūkūpandīka maswa ga kūjipīja ī mitugo jise,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mitugo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo gūtumamīlilwe ī “Mitugo” ū mu Shiswahili jikitanagwa nyumbu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " jikale mhanga; tūtizilongelwa mhayo gwa kūjibūlaga jimò nose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū būgabanha a mapandī a ga kūja, būlī ng'wene ūja iyene, ū Ahabu ūja lwakwe, nū Obadia lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Obadia aho akūbīta bītaga ūko nū kūko kwimanīla wapamanya nū Eliya. Ū Obadia ūng'witegeleja, ūtuja mazwi, winama ū būshū kūshisha hasī; ūhaya, “Baba būgonzo Eliya, hū bebe gete?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūshosha alīng'wīla, “Nalī nene ng'hana, jaga ūkang'wīle ū so būgonzo ū Ahabu gīkī, ‘Ū Eliya alīho aha.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Obadia ūshosha alīhaya, “Baba naakūkenya kī nose ū ntūmami wako ūlīnkangīīla kūlī Ahabu akabūlagwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, ū Mulungu wako; gīkī lītīho ihanga lyose lyose nūūlū būtemi ūko ataalī kūtwaala munhū kūkūkooba. Nīyo būl'ihanga nūūlū būtemi wene ūlū būhaya gīkī ūtīmo ū mu sī yabo, akūbilahījaga bahaye gīkī ng'hana bataalī ū kūkūbona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī haha ūlīniwīīla naje ū kūlī baba būgonzo nakang'wīle gīkī, ‘Ū Eliya alīho aha!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ūlū nalīnge a henaha natamanile ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA akūkūbūūcha akūtwale halī. Hūna ūlū nūja kūng'wīla ū Ahabu gīkī ūlīho aha alīyo wiza ūkūgayiwa, akūnibūlaga! Alīyo ū nene ntūmami wako nalī namya o ng'wa SEEBA wa shikū jose kūfuma ha būyanda wane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba būgonzo, ūtaalī hamo shi ū kūwīlwa īyo nakīīta aho Yezebeli wababūlagaga a bahangi ba ng'wa SEEBA? Ī gīkī nakababisa bahangi ba ng'wa SEEBA mu mahalo abīlī, būl'ihalo lyene nūtūūla moi banhū makūmi atanò, hūna nūyūbinha shilīwa na minzī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe nang'ho ī haha ūlīniwīla naje kūlī baba būgonzo nakang'wīle gīkī, ‘Ū Eliya alīho aha!’ Akūnibūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūhaya, “Nalīkwilahīlīla mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA mpanga, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli ūyo nalī ntūmami wakwe, gīkī ī lelo yenīyī nakwiyoolecha ū kūlī Ahabu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahabu kūmona Eliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Obadia ūja ng'hana ū kūlī Ahabu ūūkang'wīla, ū Ahabu ūja ū kwibona nū Eliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahabu aho wamona ū Eliya ūng'wīla, “Hū bebe gete ū nuhya wa Baisilaeli?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūshosha, “Ū nene nataalī kūbaluhya a Baisilaeli, ū bebe nī numba ya ng'wa so hū mulī baluhya ba Baisilaeli. Nguno ng'washiponya ī shilagīlo sha ng'wa SEEBA, gīkī mulondeele Mabaalī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, lagījaga bize pye a banhū kūfuma hose hose ū mu Isilaeli, twize twibonele kū lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli; babize ho na a bahangi abo bakalīīlaga ha meza ya ng'wa Yezebeli; a ba ng'wa Baalī abo magana anè na makūmi atanò, na a ba ng'wa Ashela abo magana anè.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bahangi ba ng'wa Baalī kūlemeelwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Ahabu ūbatūmīla nhūng'wa pye a Baisilaeli na a bahangi; biza kwibilingīla ha lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eliya ūbegeela a banhū benabo, ūbawīla gīkī, “Mukūhanahana ha gatī ya maganiko abīlī kūshisha nanalī? Ū SEEBA ūlū alī Mulungu, nondeelagi ng'wene, alīyo ūlū mulībona gīkī ū Baalī hū ng'wene ū mulungu, nodeelagi wei.” Alīyo a banhū būgayiwa ū gwa kūshosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eliya ūbawīla, “Ī haha ū mu bahangi ba ng'wa SEEBA abo basaagile nalī iyene dūhū, alīyo a bahangi ba ng'wa Baalī balī magana anè na makūmi atanò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū tūpandīkīlagi nzagamb'ibīlī ja ng'ombe; a boi basole īyo balayītogwe, hanuma bībbutagūle mapingili mapingili, hūna bītūūle ha ng'hwi, gwike yaya ū kūtūūla ho ū moto. Nane nakwībeeja ī nzagamba ī yīngī, nītūūle ha ng'hwi, nū nene yaya ū ūkūtūūla hoi moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ya henaho mukūnomba ū mulungu wing'we mu lina lyakwe; nū nene nakūg'witana ū SEEBA. Ū Mulungu ūyo alaafunye ishosho mu nzīla ya kwenha moto, ū ng'wenūyo hū ū Mulungu wa ng'hana.” Pye a banhū būshosha balīhaya, “Būgatū watūngīlīja a kahayīle.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūbawīla a bahangi ba ng'wa Baalī, “A bing'we solagi ī nzagamba īyo mulītogwa ng'wandye ū kwībeegeleja nguno mulī bingī. Litanagi ī lina lya ng'wa mulungu wing'we; gwike yaya ū kūtūūla hoi ū moto.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana bīsola ī nzagamb'īyo bakinhwa, bībeegeleja. Hūna bandya ū kūlitana ī lina lya ng'wa Baalī; bitana no kūfuma dilū kūshisha līīmi ntwe gatī, kūnū bakūyoganyaga būhaya, “Baalī ka twidīkage!” Alīyo lyalī ndūhū nūūlū ishosho; atigelile wa kūshosha mhayo. Babina no bakūgwipīndīlījaga ū ng'walīlo ūyo baalī baagūbeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ntwe gatī wandya kūbīītīla maneene ū Eliya akūbawīlaga, “Hamukagi gete; angū mulungu a hene! Hamo alī mu maganiko mashimu, nūūlū hamo wakwīlīlagwa myatīla, nūūlū alī mu lūgendo! Hamo wabītīlagwa tūlo; shiigelile amishiwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana bongeja ū kūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya, kūnū bakwiyoolagūlaga na shū hamò na machimu, gīt'ūmo shalī shīmīle shabo; kūshisha būyūsūlūlūka mininga ī mibīlī yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nose lyūhūga ī līīmi, bataalī baakoolanaga nabo dūhū ū būhangi wabo, kūshish'ikanza lya kūfunya shitambò sha mhīndī. Lyalī ndūhū ishosho lyose lyose, walī atīho wa kūbashokeja mhayo, nūūlū wa kūbadīlīla ndūhū dūhū!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kwicha moto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eliya ūbawīla pye a banhū, “Negeelagi aha.” Būng'wegeela aho walī, wandya kūgūbeegeleja ū ng'walīlo go ng'wa SEEBA, gwalī gwasambaagūka sambaagūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Eliya ūsola mawe ikūmi n'abīlī, kūlenganīla nī lisaabu lya bitūnja ba ng'wa Yakobo ūyo akizīīlwa na mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wīla, “Ī lina lyako ūkūbiza Isilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mawe genayo ūgatūmamīla kūzenga ng'walīlo mu lina lya ng'wa SEEBA; hanuma ūsīmba ichongo kūgūpīndīlīja ū ng'wīlīlo gwenūyo, lya būshimu wa kūdūla kūmalīla moi idebbe na nusu lya shikolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shikolo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, mbīyū, gītī ja būsīga.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma hū ūjihela hoi nī ng'hwi, nī nzagamba wībbutagūla mapingili mapingili, ī nyama ūjitūūla a ha ng'hwi. Hanuma ya henaho ūbawīla, “Enhagi madebbe anè ga minzī mugītīīle a ha nyama nī ng'hwi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūbawīla, “Shokejagi lwa kabīlī.” Biita hoi lwa kabīlī. Ūbawīla hangī, “Shokeelagi hangī lwa kadatū.” Bīta ng'hana lūkangala lwa kadatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A minzī gūlobya hoi pye pye pye, gookala gitembeka ū mu sīlīlī ya ng'walīlo nū ng'wichongo īlo lyaalī līgūpīndīlīgije ū ng'walīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyashika ī likanza lya kūfunya shitambò ū ng'hangi Eliya wegeela, hūna ūlomba alīhaya, “Ee SEEBA, Mulungu o ng'wa Abulahamu, Isaka, na Isilaeli, ī lelo shiigelile ūmanīke gīkī ūlī Mulungu ū mu Isilaeli, na gīkī ū nene nalī ntūmami wako, nī yose yenīyī nalīyīta kūlwa kūlagīla kwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nidīkage SEEBA, niidīkage; a banhū benaba bamane gīkī ū bebe SEEBA ūlī Mulungu, na gīkī ūlī na ng'hūmbū ja kūjigalūcha ī ng'holò jabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwika moto go ng'wa SEEBA, gūshipemba ī shitambò, nī ng'hwi, na a mawe, na a maseni; na a minzī ayo gaalī ū ng'wichongo gūkama pye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū aho babona gīko būgwa hasī kūlamya; būhaya, “Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū Mulungu! Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ū Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo ū Eliya ūhamuka n'ilaka lya kūlagīla ūhaya, “Badimagi a bahangi ba ng'wa Baalī; mutizūneka nūūlū ūmò wabo apūlūgūke!” Būding'wa pye a bose, ū Eliya ūlagīja būtwalwa kū mongo gwa Kishoni būūkabūlagwa kwenūko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "SEEBA kwenha mbula",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Eliya ūng'wīla ū Ahabu, “Jaga ūkalye, ūng'we na kūng'wa; nguno gūlīho ng'hilimo gwa mbula nhaale.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Ahabu ūja kūlya shilīwa, ū Eliya ng'wene ūja kū lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli kūlomba. Ūshika ūtuja mazwi, hama winama kūshisha ū būshū wakwe būshika ha gatī ya mazwi gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe, “Linhaga ūsūūle ū kū nyanza.” Ūja ūūkalola; aho washoka ūhaya, “Ndūhū shose shose koi.” Ū Eliya ūshisha ng'hangala mpungatī alīng'wīla, “Jaga ko hangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wakwe aho washoka ū lūkangala lwa pungatī, wiza ūhaya, “Kigela koi kalunde kalīsūja kūfuma mu nyanza; kadoololo gītī shiganza sha munhū.” Ū Eliya ūhaya, “Jaga ūkang'wīle ū Ahabu gīkī, ‘Beeja beejaga wangū ī ligogoteni lyako, ūpeele ūtizūnyang'wa mbula.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lītabītile ikanza ilīhu lyūhilindūka ī lilunde, na nyaga gwandya kūhuyemba; yūtūla mbula nhaale no. Ū Ahabu ūpeela ng'wigogoteni lyakwe ūja Yezileeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 18:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguzu ja ng'wa Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA jūng'wizīīla ū Eliya, ūgwibbaata ū ng'wenda gwakwe; hūna wandya kūpeela, ūnshiga ū Ahabu ū kūja ī Yezileeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.18.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.18.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
